    dimension of ``shape``:

    >>> def f(x):
    ...   return (x + 1) * jnp.arange(3)
    >>> jnp.fromfunction(f, shape=(2,))
    Array([[0., 1., 2.],
           [0., 2., 4.]], dtype=float32)

